{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/1st_-_Game_Play.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Duriano: Epic Durian Heros</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling 3D top-down action roguelite adventure into the world of Norse Mythology, where you become the unlikely hero\u2026 a <strong>Durian</strong>! Prepare yourself, grab mighty weapons, unleash divine powers, and vanquish the Gods of Asgard! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/2nd_-_Durian_Hero_Variants.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Durian Hero Variants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Durian Heroes\u2026 Unleash the Power of Gods!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Durian hero! Each variant embodies unique powers and abilities inspired by Norse Gods and mythical creatures. Tailor your playstyle, harness their divine essence, and embark on your epic quest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/3rd_-_Fate_s_Favors_God_Path.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fate's Favors &amp; God Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your God Path\u2026 Unlock Ultimate Power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Empower your Durian Hero with &quot;Fate's Favors,&quot; granting powerful buffs and unique abilities! Select a &quot;God Path&quot; to unlock spectacular combat skills and customize your hero to perfection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/4th_Mythic_Weapon.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mythic Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mythical Arsenal Awaits\u2026 Unleash Devastating Power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and collect hundreds of &quot;Mythic Weapons,&quot; each with unique attributes and game-changing effects! Fuse weapon power with your Durian Hero's abilities to create unstoppable combos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/5th_-_Synergistic_Combos.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergistic Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Combos\u2026 Unleash Limitless Potential!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment and combine everything! Durian Hero variants, Fate's Favors, and weapons \u2013 discover synergistic combos to unleash devastating power and obliterate your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/6th_-_Adaptive_Strategy.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adaptive Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Run Unique\u2026 Conquer the Ever-Changing Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of Roguelite gameplay where every run is different! New environments, new enemies, new challenges await! Adapt your strategy on the fly and overcome every obstacle!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/7th_-_Progression_and_Customization.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progression and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Upgrades\u2026 Evolve Your Hero to Godlike Status!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep playing to unlock new Durian Hero variants, Fate's Favors, and weapons! Collect and upgrade your arsenal to make your hero stronger and face even greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/8th_-_Prepare_for_battle.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get Ready to Rumble! Dive into the mystical Norse realms, embark on an epic action-packed adventure, master devastating combos, and lead your Durian Hero to victory over the Gods of Asgard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to become the ultimate Durian Hero? Join the fight in Duriano and etch your legend into the annals of Asgardian history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/9th_-_Story.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Midguardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/6e44dd960313fb25c5ce9d497745cb829b2df158.jpg"},{"name":"Valkyrian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/1ca5a4c84043c04d8c5f574b9e3ab63238564b6c.jpg"},{"name":"God of Warhammer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/27289935bc4193da7daf8f62bf83c07c2ae2e7d6.jpg"},{"name":" Valkyrian Judgment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/7563d415b7fa3a96088ce15a2380c15212995bb3.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Yggdrazill stick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/60ef1b17425dbe53590106990a678f8555bcb927.jpg"},{"name":"Firebrand Berserker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/29f828d36e24c4b28065d7c0d4ceb7a16b3f2d00.jpg"},{"name":"Lorekeeper Alchemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/6066e9c3dc669e90486155f6d87d4de59aa76683.jpg"},{"name":"Sleipnir's Swift Rider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/5ef0a22811eef14ccaee8b05c078a21c0525770c.jpg"},{"name":"Enigmatic Runemaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/eed03f86736ddd1397b2a735475d280f5f104b1f.jpg"},{"name":"Surtr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048930/a8efe36e40c084674cd6c4b9bc1441e9ca01d137.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3048930?t=1745240078","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/95531b40b8ca4218fffbd3d3281f25a0460b3b01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745240078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/6fef626c058506ebeba5da468e66895cbba224b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745240078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/6fef626c058506ebeba5da468e66895cbba224b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745240078","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/1st_-_Game_Play.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Duriano: Epic Durian Heros</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling 3D top-down action roguelite adventure into the world of Norse Mythology, where you become the unlikely hero\u2026 a <strong>Durian</strong>! Prepare yourself, grab mighty weapons, unleash divine powers, and vanquish the Gods of Asgard! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/2nd_-_Durian_Hero_Variants.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Durian Hero Variants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Durian Heroes\u2026 Unleash the Power of Gods!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Durian hero! Each variant embodies unique powers and abilities inspired by Norse Gods and mythical creatures. Tailor your playstyle, harness their divine essence, and embark on your epic quest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/3rd_-_Fate_s_Favors_God_Path.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fate's Favors &amp; God Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your God Path\u2026 Unlock Ultimate Power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Empower your Durian Hero with &quot;Fate's Favors,&quot; granting powerful buffs and unique abilities! Select a &quot;God Path&quot; to unlock spectacular combat skills and customize your hero to perfection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/4th_Mythic_Weapon.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mythic Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mythical Arsenal Awaits\u2026 Unleash Devastating Power!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and collect hundreds of &quot;Mythic Weapons,&quot; each with unique attributes and game-changing effects! Fuse weapon power with your Durian Hero's abilities to create unstoppable combos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/5th_-_Synergistic_Combos.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergistic Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Combos\u2026 Unleash Limitless Potential!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment and combine everything! Durian Hero variants, Fate's Favors, and weapons \u2013 discover synergistic combos to unleash devastating power and obliterate your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/6th_-_Adaptive_Strategy.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adaptive Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Run Unique\u2026 Conquer the Ever-Changing Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of Roguelite gameplay where every run is different! New environments, new enemies, new challenges await! Adapt your strategy on the fly and overcome every obstacle!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/7th_-_Progression_and_Customization.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progression and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Upgrades\u2026 Evolve Your Hero to Godlike Status!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep playing to unlock new Durian Hero variants, Fate's Favors, and weapons! Collect and upgrade your arsenal to make your hero stronger and face even greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/8th_-_Prepare_for_battle.png?t=1745240078\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get Ready to Rumble! Dive into the mystical Norse realms, embark on an epic action-packed adventure, master devastating combos, and lead your Durian Hero to victory over the Gods of Asgard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to become the ultimate Durian Hero? Join the fight in Duriano and etch your legend into the annals of Asgardian history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/extras/9th_-_Story.gif?t=1745240078\" /></p>","developers":["Adisoft Gaming Co.,Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048930/f3f3b3ee3c1b6a036cb4dc5705fae82c6381e9c9/header.jpg?t=1745240078","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Chip<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Designed for 30 FPS gameplay at 720p resolution</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Chip<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Optimized for 60 FPS gameplay at 1080p resolution</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128740,"mp4":{"480":"http://vide